{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — VIP Day and tailored wellness guidance in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#0f1720; --card:#07101a; --muted:#9aa7b2; --accent:#6de0c9; --accent-2:#6aa7ff; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --radius:12px; --max-width:1100px; --gap:24px; font-family: system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,'Noto Sans',sans-serif;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#071225 60%);color:#e6f0f2;line-height:1.45}
    header{padding:28px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:var(--max-width);margin:0 auto}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#042028}
    nav ul{display:flex;gap:14px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:9px}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:#042028;font-weight:600}
    main{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:18px auto;padding:20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(2,6,10,0.6)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px}
    p.lead-sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px 0}
    .meta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:18px}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .contact-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .chip{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    button.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border:0;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#042028;font-weight:700}
    button.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:10px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)}
    .try-btn{display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}

    /* Reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1),transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.2,1)}
    .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    /* right column */
    .side{position:sticky;top:28px;align-self:start;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
    .map-like{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);height:220px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    footer{max-width:var(--max-width);margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}

    /* modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.55),rgba(0,0,0,0.7));display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60}
    .overlay.active{display:flex}
    .modal{width:min(880px,96%);background:#021017;padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(2,6,10,0.7);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    .modal h3{margin:0 0 8px 0}
    .exercise-area{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px}
    .circle{width:160px;height:160px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,rgba(109,224,201,0.12),transparent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;color:var(--muted)}
    .progress{height:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-radius:999px;width:100%;overflow:hidden}
    .bar{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));width:0%}
    .modal .sidebar{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}
    .choices{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .choice{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);cursor:pointer}
    .choice.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(109,224,201,0.03),transparent)}
    .modal .actions{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px}

    /* decorative pattern */
    .pattern-area{height:120px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}
    .pattern-svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}

    @media (max-width:980px){
      main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .modal{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .side{position:static}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">W</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Tailored sessions • VIP Day available</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="about.html">Philosophy</a></li>
        <li><a href="services.html">Offerings</a></li>
        <li><a href="programs.html">Tracks</a></li>
        <li><a href="pricing.html">Investment</a></li>
        <li><a href="testimonials.html">Voices</a></li>
        <li><a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
        <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="lead reveal" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <h1 id="contact-heading">Reach out — schedule a focused session</h1>
      <p class="lead-sub">If you're curious about a VIP Day, a short coaching series, or a bespoke habit plan, let's talk logistics and fit. We center outcomes, repeatable habits, and simple frameworks that slot into real schedules.</p>
      <div class="meta">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span class="chip">VIP Day</span>
          <span class="chip">Remote or in-person in {{CITY}}</span>
          <span class="chip">Short-term plans</span>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:6px">
          <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" class="try-btn button ghost" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)">Email: {{EMAIL}}</a>
          <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" class="try-btn button ghost" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>
          <button class="try-btn primary" id="open-exercise" aria-haspopup="dialog">Try a quick exercise</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <strong>What to expect</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:14px">A focused intake, practical micro-habits you can test for two weeks, and a follow-up check-in.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <strong>Timing</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:14px">Most first calls are 30–40 minutes. VIP Days are full-day intensives with prep and resources.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <strong>Fees</strong>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0 0;font-size:14px">Transparent pricing and clear deliverables. See Investment for current offers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <aside class="side">
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 10px 0">Quick contact</h4>
        <div class="contact-list">
          <div class="contact-item"><div class="chip">Email</div><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          <div class="contact-item"><div class="chip">Phone</div><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
          <div class="contact-item"><div class="chip">Location</div><div style="color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Book a slot</h4>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:14px">If you'd like direct booking, click below — I prioritize clarity and a compact agenda for each session.</p>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="primary" style="display:inline-block;text-align:center">Reserve: {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal pattern-area" aria-hidden="true">
        <!-- Decorative SVG pattern inline as fallback. In production, add assets/img/pattern.svg for progressive enhancement. -->
        <svg class="pattern-svg" viewBox="0 0 600 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
              <stop offset="0" stop-color="#052b28" stop-opacity="0.9"/>
              <stop offset="1" stop-color="#032133" stop-opacity="0.85"/>
            </linearGradient>
            <pattern id="p1" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(20)">
              <rect width="20" height="20" fill="#072226" />
              <circle cx="30" cy="10" r="4" fill="#08323a" />
            </pattern>
          </defs>
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g1)" />
          <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" opacity="0.55" />
          <g fill="none" stroke="#0fcfb2" stroke-opacity="0.07">
            <path d="M0 80c40-40 120-40 160 0s120 40 160 0 120-40 160 0"/>
            <path d="M0 40c60-30 140-20 200 0s140 30 200 0"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="card reveal" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
        <strong style="font-size:14px">Availability</strong>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <span class="chip">Morning slots</span>
          <span class="chip">Afternoons</span>
          <span class="chip">VIP Day dates</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    <div style="color:var(--muted)">Made for clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="privacy.html" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline">Privacy</a></div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Modal: Guided exercise -->
  <div class="overlay" id="exercise-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="document" aria-labelledby="exercise-title">
      <div class="exercise-area">
        <h3 id="exercise-title">Short practice</h3>
        <p style="color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px 0">Choose a 2–5 minute option to reset. These are non-clinical practices focused on clarity, calm, and setting intention.</p>

        <div class="circle" id="exercise-circle">Ready</div>
        <div style="width:100%">
          <div class="progress"><div class="bar" id="progress-bar"></div></div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
          <button class="ghost" id="close-modal">Close</button>
          <button class="primary" id="start-exercise">Start</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="sidebar modal-right">
        <div class="sidebar">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Pick a practice</h4>
          <div class="choices" role="list">
            <div class="choice active" data-mode="breath" role="option">Breath reset — 2 minutes</div>
            <div class="choice" data-mode="journ" role="option">Micro-journal — 3 minutes</div>
            <div class="choice" data-mode="intent" role="option">Set an intention — 1 minute</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Tip: Use this to center yourself before a call or meeting. Animations reduce if you prefer less motion.</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Footer year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Reveal on scroll with reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const els = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        els.forEach(e=>e.classList.add('in'));
        return;
      }
      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
          entries.forEach(ent=>{
            if(ent.isIntersecting){ ent.target.classList.add('in'); io.unobserve(ent.target); }
          });
        },{threshold:0.12});
        els.forEach(e=>io.observe(e));
      } else {
        // fallback
        els.forEach(e=>e.classList.add('in'));
      }
    })();

    // Guided exercise modal logic
    (function(){
      const overlay = document.getElementById('exercise-modal');
      const openBtn = document.getElementById('open-exercise');
      const closeBtn = document.getElementById('close-modal');
      const startBtn = document.getElementById('start-exercise');
      const choices = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.choice'));
      const circle = document.getElementById('exercise-circle');
      const bar = document.getElementById('progress-bar');

      let mode = 'breath';
      let timer = null;
      let total = 120; // seconds default 2 minutes
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

      choices.forEach(c=>{
        c.addEventListener('click',()=>{
          choices.forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));
          c.classList.add('active');
          mode = c.getAttribute('data-mode');
          updateMode();
        });
      });

      function updateMode(){
        if(mode === 'breath'){ total = 120; circle.textContent = 'Breath — 2 min'; }
        if(mode === 'journ'){ total = 180; circle.textContent = 'Journal — 3 min'; }
        if(mode === 'intent'){ total = 60; circle.textContent = 'Intend — 1 min'; }
        bar.style.width = '0%';
      }
      updateMode();

      openBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        overlay.classList.add('active');
        overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','false');
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        // trap focus minimally
        setTimeout(()=>startBtn.focus(),100);
      });
      closeBtn.addEventListener('click',closeModal);
      overlay.addEventListener('click',(e)=>{ if(e.target === overlay) closeModal(); });
      function closeModal(){
        overlay.classList.remove('active');
        overlay.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
        clearInterval(timer);
        timer = null;
        bar.style.width = '0%';
        circle.textContent = (mode==='breath'?'Breath — 2 min':mode==='journ'?'Journal — 3 min':'Intend — 1 min');
      }

      startBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        if(timer) return; // already running
        let remaining = total;
        // For journaling we show a prompt
        if(mode === 'journ'){
          circle.textContent = 'Write: What matters most today?';
        } else if(mode === 'intent'){
          circle.textContent = 'Focus: One clear intention';
        } else {
          circle.textContent = 'Breathe: in… out…';
        }
        // If reduced motion, simply set a timeout and close
        if(prefersReduced){
          setTimeout(()=>{ bar.style.width = '100%'; setTimeout(closeModal,500); }, total*1000);
          return;
        }

        timer = setInterval(()=>{
          remaining -= 1;
          const pct = Math.round(((total - remaining)/total)*100);
          bar.style.width = pct + '%';
          // micro copy updates for breath
          if(mode === 'breath'){
            // 4-4 breathing cycle cue
            const cycle = remaining % 8;
            if(cycle >=4) circle.textContent = 'Breathe out'; else circle.textContent = 'Breathe in';
          } else if(mode === 'journ'){
            if(remaining === total - 30) circle.textContent = 'Prompt: List 3 wins';
          } else if(mode === 'intent'){
            if(remaining < total/2) circle.textContent = 'Hold it — anchor briefly';
          }
          if(remaining <= 0){ clearInterval(timer); timer=null; bar.style.width='100%'; circle.textContent='Done — carry it forward'; setTimeout(closeModal,900); }
        },1000);
      });

      // keyboard: Esc to close
      document.addEventListener('keydown',(e)=>{ if(e.key === 'Escape'){ if(overlay.classList.contains('active')) closeModal(); } });
    })();

    // Progressive enhancement note: if you add an external decorative SVG, place it at assets/img/pattern.svg
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# Contact page (chunk 4) — wellness_coach-MORE-2026-02-17T02-40-34-820Z-008

This bundle includes the contact page HTML and notes for deployment. It is crafted for a wellness coaching site with a VIP Day offer model and a split_diagonal layout family.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — the full contact page, self-contained (CSS/JS inline). Includes a guided exercise modal and scroll reveal behavior.
- README.md — this file (instructions and notes).

Placeholders to replace (must be replaced during site build or templating):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Key features implemented in contact.html:
- Navigation with unique label set: Home, Philosophy, Offerings, Tracks, Investment, Voices, Book a VIP, Contact.
- A modern contact layout: left content + right sticky contact and booking summary.
- Decorative SVG pattern included inline for immediate visual richness. You may also add a separate asset at assets/img/pattern.svg for progressive enhancement.
- Try it now: a guided exercise modal with three short practices (breath reset, micro-journal, intention setting). Runs purely in local JS, accessible (aria), keyboard-close via Esc, respects prefers-reduced-motion.
- Scroll-triggered reveal for page sections implemented with IntersectionObserver and a reduced-motion fallback that disables animation.
- No external fonts, CDNs, or images (SVG pattern is inline). If you want a separate file, create assets/img/pattern.svg and reference it from CSS if desired.

Accessibility & motion:
- The reveal animations are disabled when the user prefers reduced motion (matchMedia query).
- Modal is marked with role="dialog" and aria-modal; focus moves to the Start button on open.
- Keyboard users can close the modal with Escape.

Behavior notes for integrators:
- The contact form is intentionally simple; adapt validation and form handling to your backend or embed your scheduling link at {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}.
- The guided exercise is non-clinical and designed to be a brief centering practice. It uses timers and simple DOM updates — you can extend modes or customize copy.
- If you add a separate SVG file, place it at assets/img/pattern.svg. The page includes an inline pattern so it looks complete without external assets.

Customization tips:
- Swap colors in the :root block inside the contact.html head to match your brand.
- Edit the choices or durations for the guided exercise in the inline script.
- For server-side templates, replace placeholders before serving the file.

Developer notes:
- This chunk intentionally includes only contact.html and README.md. Other pages (index.html, about.html, services.html, programs.html, pricing.html, testimonials.html, book.html) are expected to be in other chunks of the project.
- Keep the unique copy and nav labels consistent across other pages for coherence, but ensure at least two other pages change their section order relative to index (project-level requirement).

If you need a different behavior for the modal or additional micro-interactions, request another chunk and specify which page to modify.
"} 
